-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components and assets (not covered by the MIT license above)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- Fonts Nunito and Bricolage Grotesque: SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (project/assets/fonts/OFL.txt, project/assets/fonts/OFL_Bricolage.txt).
- gdUnit4 test framework: MIT License (project/addons/gdUnit4/LICENSE).
- Godot Engine: MIT License (https://godotengine.org/license). Not included
  in this repository; the exported app contains the Godot runtime.

Assets made for this project:

- 3D rooms, furniture, figures and portraits are generated procedurally by the
  Blender/Python scripts in art_source/scripts/ (no third-party models).
- Sound effects are synthesized by art_source/scripts/build_sounds.py
  (Python standard library, no samples).
- The app icon was created with an AI image generator (ChatGPT) from a prompt
  by the author and post-processed with art_source/icon/icon_m3_einbau.py.
These project assets are released under the same MIT license as the code.
